  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Flow of adding a set of triple through RI:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. RI receives set of triples",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. RI wraps the iterator of the received set with a localizing filter",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. RI passes wrapped iterator to trippi",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. ConcurrentTripleStoreWriter iterates through all items in iterator adding to a List<Triple> of default size",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. ConcurrentTripleStoreWriter calls another public method to add the list",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The TripleStoreWriter and UpdateBuffer interfaces should be changed to accept Collection<Triple>, or have methods added to accept Set<Triple>.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
