  "description": "<p>Flow of adding a set of triple through RI:<br/>\n1. RI receives set of triples<br/>\n2. RI wraps the iterator of the received set with a localizing filter<br/>\n3. RI passes wrapped iterator to trippi<br/>\n4. ConcurrentTripleStoreWriter iterates through all items in iterator adding to a List&lt;Triple&gt; of default size<br/>\n5. ConcurrentTripleStoreWriter calls another public method to add the list</p>\n\n<p>The TripleStoreWriter and UpdateBuffer interfaces should be changed to accept Collection&lt;Triple&gt;, or have methods added to accept Set&lt;Triple&gt;.</p>",
